#: scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fdec74638115537045682f57c0f6c2d6af4d5ffea7ecf289d47357643b46986
#. default-sha256: e0d2c4f059828a0db9d48be1f2e4a22072b69bc23d89de9e9eb7897a07b2c320
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DEEBF9E7_AD5C_4EA7_BFC0_0BDEC2E7DFE2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫His eyebrows were furrowed, creating deep creases on his "
"forehead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫その時……、⟪k:8⟫彼はとても険しい表情を浮かべておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e498748135cab4bcfed4dbbe894f759b8bfce407ecf8822df5c82918a62e7bbe
#. default-sha256: a5996accc6d899d1ddfb51158fe4c8b891c2076824e8d94b6c62f0e388cb8898
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D45B5FCA_5D60_4431_BFFF_60E9F8A95EDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Several servants stood off to the side, watching their master attentively as he stomped past "
"them down the corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫靴音を鳴らし大股で廊下を歩む主人の姿に、⟪k:1⟫何人かの使用人は何事かと目を瞠りましたけれども……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f38006f09957f33da035ff5dd8e7072c666d3b56417b1de7a432be609913edb6
#. default-sha256: ef1108fdf1b977b280fbda8912a7a7a05fe9da3279a08dbff0e2bcb5cb2e48a5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB23B185_3C98_4A22_961D_7F78A5D37274"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, no one said a word to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰も声を掛けようとはしませんでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 366a6231ee9144617ff8a417e4922a4d3753f9366eb4cadfbc7e90cfff6642bc
#. default-sha256: 162eddc9610851300d1182dc0ace7f81c50b7fe65e4d306766b6ea84d0e406d1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_621886FE_B154_42C2_95E1_319ABE98F6A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had I not been preoccupied attending to his countryman..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫当時のわたくしが、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼の同郷の者などの対応に追われてなければ……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92b8e944cdaab22a397f9804fe6a69e73f6b03e7d9a5cb5e7417d76dea3980d4
#. default-sha256: d1370def22b99292697ad65968bfce21195aceaa5c0e7e326baea51d3f1dabd8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E2E929C_3397_45DA_9D13_F550D9D64B36"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I likely could have prevented it. ⟪k:1⟫The look on his face would have made it obvious "
"something bad was about to happen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫きっと、⟪k:1⟫わたくしが止められたはずなのに。⟪k:2⟫だって、⟪k:3⟫その表情を見れば悪い予感しか無"
"いじゃありませんか。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 687ea80b76344baaba65bc6cd5b65c52d40178326deb15eed638924ae9100d59
#. default-sha256: 56a5680524aead2059a007e23d474d192e705604a6a585a527d8a107707871c2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB124CDA_06A0_40A4_B48D_4C788CC3C5C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Something that would serve only to further her misfortune."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の不幸が、⟪k:1⟫また膨らんでいってしまう……そんな、⟪k:2⟫悪い予感。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d95758dcc46bc443896003994498ddc9640a86c109d773901d0e14cae2d464e
#. default-sha256: 05296ca52534466923a57cd67c4eb6a4652c741dfa762655c7c3875c0c15e621
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD6C8D50_71DF_468B_BB0E_28D21C6CED84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was already in a less-than-ideal situation..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう既に、⟪k:1⟫彼女の置かれている状況は、⟪k:2⟫決して良いとは言えないものだったのに――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed84d526e7509d11375f17cb7c2414b77eff339c0bdc9c0aeb6703e8bbcc13cb
#. default-sha256: b209a337df2bdac67805559d091b813c6bde00caee7274cdc7e8234a8f087b53
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD0CD29_9AA8_4F02_95D7_5BFA9472D9BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and it was perched on the edge of a hill, soon to begin rolling down into even worse "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それが、⟪k:1⟫坂道を転がり落ちていくように、⟪k:2⟫より悪い方向へと――⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫その時、⟪k:5⟫変化"
"しようとしておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 020683a0484ab9ac99c6e3281ecdd8c83fee4924d4ce5b23068d81e538e35f39
#. default-sha256: 82412ea442e337adb2abbedc924b6104cc3d9e18cd396f5db78f7ad67c2812dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35EB0DD6_8F2D_43CF_B988_9B60E252CBA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫\t\t⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37808cb3d88c310561f20e56e396a31ed797fb5404aa4d549ddd3bc53bf1aba7
#. default-sha256: 52ba3993924ce4983b2e8055a5c0d4e191814ee5810f36cb2c46e8dc8ae623e7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9D9C0F1_53A4_45D8_ADF1_A00DF53E7815"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫J-⟪k:1⟫Jacopo?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あ、⟪k:1⟫あなた……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beaa52e7abd8c8a7850b58fd931f36f613f4bec1b81bc102a93e25ad5eb7d548
#. default-sha256: 0b7e5087d5e68ea76419483527e7d95ada296576ed07c3410cf2f3dfe6094e3f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_458D4615_C573_4AFB_8C6F_895C44935729"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:1⟫If you wanted to visit,⟪k:2⟫you could have said something,⟪k:3⟫rather "
"than coming in without knocking..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どうしたんですか、⟪k:1⟫急に――そんな、⟪k:2⟫ノックもせずに……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫お越しになるのなら、"
"⟪k:5⟫仰っていただけたら……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58702f7a62caeb4ada7735f3922cc97ee7f3337dc682b6c3d481b06cc131bd27
#. default-sha256: 516e87d68202ba83df97d1bf2c7412f7ac034214f2a806073136ffce3b0e77ca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2CB44302_C7F4_4FBF_8044_6F8447035E76"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is that... ⟪k:1⟫really necessary?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……しないと、⟪k:1⟫ならないのか……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea3155a6b029eebb00f713c093108a78174345198e578f8ae154c5f38c14073e
#. default-sha256: 9e8871373287c15925346c076f96444b3984eba9bc027cf2d1d5387a21afdef7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5D7311C3_EBB9_4D79_9679_B329368EC393"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Pardon...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫え………？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9bf39eb440c10ad47781f74935b0fe92cc12697500ecd42e8e75c23d2cc6fed
#. default-sha256: 10a6a255e0673fdf957b7c79511947d9786afa08de002110f41feb61537a1c8f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50F2B486_E343_43DE_BD33_53EBE3D9369B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Is there something you so "
"desperately want to keep from me that I must ⟪k:12⟫knock⟪k:13⟫ before entering?! That I should "
"have to let you know in advance that I’m coming?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫ノックをしなければならんほど、⟪k:12⟫"
"隠したいものでもあるのか！⟪k:13⟫　私がここに来ると、⟪k:14⟫誰かに言伝しなければならないのか！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f77279cd0778a0a9909697376878a25f5f8f9b111409a074f862d80ce821462
#. default-sha256: d6b09bbbeb6e4777d56ad2cd8d57385094c965accd4a62f0bb5c96f119f01b46
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C21552BE_DC90_4421_84B0_475F9A495E98"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Wh-⟪k:1⟫What— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫え、⟪k:1⟫え――、⟪k:2⟫あなた、⟪k:3⟫何を……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 369ce6d82a22c098c712fdb40783298b2bbcff7d224ef806679d6055e802ef82
#. default-sha256: 4df48dee61344ebf205fd8a8ddbc593b4ce89c3c896b953b510856613eb7ee14
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB18F7D5_9D06_4F75_9ADC_BDE7A2B489CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Well?! ⟪k:1⟫Is there?!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You went to talk to ⟪k:5⟫him⟪k:6⟫ behind my back, I’m "
"told!⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫What’d you tell him?! You moan to him about my behavior?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ええ！？　⟪k:1⟫どうなんだ！　⟪k:2⟫私に黙って奴に相談か！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫何を言った？　⟪k:5⟫私の振"
"る舞いに文句でもつけにいったか！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7784040e82561012fa53f4ccc5b3c9b2537e168dde49f105117ca6092cdc253
#. default-sha256: 71e5b766c2cc850da4b5a72122faf3fe2e152b48c965d02fbb0dba837d97dee5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F67CBE6B_5A5D_4BDC_85B5_C83332780DB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫—?! ⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Ah—! ⟪k:15⟫"
"⟪k:16⟫Ngh, ⟪k:17⟫that hurts!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫―――ッ！？　⟪k:13⟫あっ……！　"
"⟪k:14⟫う、⟪k:15⟫……痛いッ……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b2461cadb671ed0b7922115b456f2743d277806dba99ea29c5d47d99a56e236
#. default-sha256: 5952310471b165afe9d755c310bff7b068cfa756df97cb9e176636f22f78beb2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56133238_9AFE_46C2_AE40_146A4E02CA49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You told him I’m rough with you?!⟪k:1⟫You cried on his shoulder because I’m not ⟪k:2⟫nice "
"enough⟪k:3⟫?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Him!⟪k:7⟫ Of all people!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私が手厳しいだと！？　⟪k:1⟫優しくないと泣きついたのか！　⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫よりによって、⟪k:4⟫あんな"
"男に！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4c32b67237fdb87f709ac63621ba29b67f1dfe125d6c301e797320b54fd0580
#. default-sha256: 6d8ccd5107dd63a575aaeac71d7eaefa483aa638cf813842fa7f0a7bf25e4aca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A545B7E9_6952_4FD5_8931_2C61301376E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫W-⟪k:13⟫Wait, Jacopo!⟪k:14⟫"
"⟪k:15⟫You’re mistaken! Let me—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫ま、⟪k:13⟫待って、⟪k:14⟫あなた"
"――！　⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫誤解をしています、⟪k:17⟫話を……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82f18efab72e0b19def9de2ffaae7a7cf084eb5e11ea887c5a4b086acdd56b33
#. default-sha256: 464f3024c755c538130ad6455a3bbf7f5c1f7134d8775ca0beb29dba45b23c62
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74215A9D_29DA_4DAD_9359_CD732F2F5186"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Silence! Not a word! Not a single godforsaken word!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The only thing that comes out "
"of your mouth is excuses!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Lies and fabrication!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫うるさいッ、⟪k:1⟫黙れ、⟪k:2⟫黙れ黙れ黙れッ！！　⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫お前の言葉は全部言い訳だ、⟪k:5⟫全部"
"嘘だらけだ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f20c16f65675c42e3ac54e46dbbcf1325b19745c92d9215103b38ad629f0320
#. default-sha256: 2a469d6158d8bab5f8d300f2085191d33430f1d80a6ded3ed86a863260788823
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1101EC98_EE9E_4344_AE98_E834C4B1E946"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You put on this sweet, innocent little girl act,⟪k:1⟫but what’s ⟪k:2⟫really⟪k:3⟫ going "
"through your head?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Maybe I should just rip that mask off your face!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いつもいつも貞淑な振りをして――内では何を考えているんだ！　⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫いっそ、⟪k:3⟫その面の皮を"
"剥いでやろうか……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5cbf8fcf4fd608526ea8c6806e25e1bfb2487ce233f9945b478de47ce4c0d28
#. default-sha256: a8da3b15d272562b6e61b27ed7144d08d2b1c38dbe4a86f542f2ef7d931c3fe5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_56598359_5762_4D24_92A8_0AE6BDD415E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫S-⟪k:1⟫Stop— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Jacopo!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫や、⟪k:1⟫やめ、⟪k:2⟫……あなた……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5430C9E4_D756_4A69_A643_FE060E198187
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed13167e88201afb5156edb82cd7c796d06f01258eb67973fafa3afb1331eb9e
#. default-sha256: cc26743346ac4b9fad51bd817eb484fed91b48e26881a2db60cc425e25ed528d
